From cd0122a251b8b10492df1b914160dc98eac24152 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:13:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Leave Cargo native C dialect selection to build scripts

Base: rust-v0.162.1 (092d3acd6bec3e3a14bdc7e7a2810ab628ab759d) with the existing issue-61 queue and native MSVC analysis fixture. RED: native Cargo CFLAGS contain /std:c17. GREEN: the Cargo action exports no default C standard, retains /MT exactly once, and retains /WX. Evidence: windows-wrapper-gbpNjj compiler-flags-native-red.log and compiler-flags-batch-green.log. Fresh emitted patch and native Windows execution remain required gates.
